{
  "version": 1,
  "notes": [
    "Second native-only bearer, murage_pa_, minted on the same two bootstrap routes as murage_pj_ with scope ask. It carries no authority beyond targets, share and ask.",
    "Signed mint message: UTF-8 of tag murage-phone-ask/1, origin, keyId, nonce and decimal expiresAt joined by LF, no trailing newline. Same signature rules as phone-jobs.json (ECDSA P-256 over SHA-256, ASN.1 DER, base64url). A jobs signature never verifies as an ask mint and the reverse.",
    "Every body is strict: an unknown key, including via, origin and ownerActs, is refused with 422 and nothing is stored (plan B12).",
    "Share body is multipart/form-data: part manifest (application/json) first, then item-1 .. item-n in n order, each with filename and the item mime. multipart.body is byte exact (CRLF line ends).",
    "An entry in an invalid list with a repeat field has a body whose array at repeat.path holds one element; expand it to repeat.count copies before use.",
    "targets carry no message text anywhere."
  ],
